  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **TWOD 20171101 In Chains**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **TWOD 20171101 Holding On**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **TWOD 20171101 An Ocean In Betwen The Waves**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **TWOD 20171101 Strangest Thing**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **TWOD 20171101 Nothing To Find**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **TWOD 20171101 Knocked Down**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **TWOD 20171101 Buenos Aires Beach**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n- **TWOD 20171101 Red Eyes**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **twod2017-11-01.flac16** (recommended): source not stated; 14 songs; 121 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: Vocals were poor live but improved in the recording; minor audience noise present; The stack recording features real nice clarity; The sound is very clear [1][2][3]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- This was the opening show of their European Tour at Afas Live [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **twod2017-11-01.flac16**: taped by Young Dutch Master; transferred by Young Dutch Master; source: SP - CMC-8 microphones + Roland Edirol R-09 [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by Arend Jan Hermsen: [Foto The War On Drugs in AFAS Live op 1 november 2017 op Podiuminfo. Foto 5 van 12.](https://www.podiuminfo.nl/image/104572/The-War-On-Drugs-0111-AFAS-Live/The-War-On-Drugs/) [5]",
